      "side": 0,
      "message": "No, sorry, the comment wasn\u0027t very clear. The comment means that `inversesqrt(negativeVal)` shouldn\u0027t optimize away because `1/sqrt(x)` is undefined for x\u003c0, and our strategy for constant-time evaluation of undefined behavior is to leave the original call as-is and pass it through to the driver instead of replacing it with the evaluated result.",
